343
00:36:51,260 --> 00:37:01,230
We built a model in collaboration with Google DeepMind that can track you spatially, and it creates a three-dimensional, essentially pose of you from a flat, two-dimensional video.
我们与谷歌深度思维合作开发了一个模型，能够空间追踪你，并从平面的二维视频中生成你的三维姿态。

344
00:37:01,230 --> 00:37:02,230
So awesome.
太棒了。

345
00:37:02,230 --> 00:37:03,688
I mean, I love it.
我真的太喜欢了。

346
00:37:03,688 --> 00:37:05,150
I can't even see you here.
我甚至都看不见你在这里。

347
00:37:05,150 --> 00:37:06,310
How does it do it?
它是怎么做到的？

348
00:37:06,310 --> 00:37:09,710
This was my tight pant, leather jacket phase.
这是我穿紧身裤配皮夹克的阶段。

349
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:11,790
So you got to really punch in on it.
所以你得真正下功夫去投入。

350
00:37:11,790 --> 00:37:14,750
I know. I got some out back, too.
我知道，我后头也有些。

351
00:37:14,750 --> 00:37:15,550
It was a good look.
这看起来很棒。

352
00:37:15,550 --> 00:37:17,128
I know. It's still a good look.
我知道，现在还是很好看。

353
00:37:17,128 --> 00:37:17,870
All right.
好吧。

354
00:37:17,870 --> 00:37:19,670
Let's talk about the next thing.
我们来谈谈下一件事。

355
00:37:19,670 --> 00:37:21,890
These are stats powered by Gemini.
这些数据由 Gemini 提供支持。

356
00:37:21,890 --> 00:37:27,092
Here, we're tracking your flight dynamics, rotational velocity, and even your tuck compression.
这里，我们正在追踪你的飞行动态、旋转速度，甚至你的收身压缩情况。

357
00:37:27,092 --> 00:37:28,550
Yeah, this is amazing.
是啊，这太棒了。

358
00:37:28,550 --> 00:37:29,675
We didn't have this before.
我们以前没有这个。

359
00:37:29,675 --> 00:37:31,910
I can see how much time I've spent in the air.
我能清楚看到自己在空中花了多少时间。

360
00:37:31,910 --> 00:37:39,550
And now take old footage that I've done and compare it with new footage of how much time was I in the air when I landed the trick, and when I didn't land the trick.
现在把过去的老视频和新视频对比，看看我完成动作时和没完成动作时，空中停留时间的差别。

361
00:37:39,550 --> 00:37:40,710
And I can compare the two.
我可以对两者进行比较。

362
00:37:40,710 --> 00:37:42,950
And that data is really going to help me progress.
这些数据真的会帮助我取得进展。

363
00:37:42,950 --> 00:37:45,990
And obviously, the next generation can use these tools too.
显然，下一代也能使用这些工具。

364
00:37:45,990 --> 00:37:46,350
It's true.
没错。

365
00:37:46,350 --> 00:37:50,710
And what I love is I love seeing how quickly your rotational velocity gets up here.
我最喜欢的是，能看到你的旋转速度迅速提升到这个水平。

366
00:37:50,710 --> 00:37:52,303
It's all about how you exit the pipe.
关键在于你如何从管道中退出。

367
00:37:52,303 --> 00:37:54,470
Torque-- exactly, and coming out of it.
扭矩——没错，就是从里面出来的时候。

368
00:37:54,470 --> 00:37:54,830
All right.
好的。

369
00:37:54,830 --> 00:37:58,030
So let's look at one more cool thing that we've done here, which is the ribbon overlay.
那么我们再来看一个这里做的酷炫功能，就是丝带叠加效果。

370
00:37:58,030 --> 00:37:58,950
Oh, I love this.
哦，我太喜欢这个了。

371
00:37:58,950 --> 00:38:01,033
So here's what I love about this.
我最喜欢的就是这个。

372
00:38:01,033 --> 00:38:04,030
We're actually showing your cork here with the whole visualization.
我们实际上在这里完整展示了你的软木塞的可视化效果。

373
00:38:04,030 --> 00:38:05,610
So what happens here?
那么这里会发生什么？

374
00:38:05,610 --> 00:38:08,030
We're moving from blue to green on the thing.
我们正在把这个从蓝色变为绿色。

375
00:38:08,030 --> 00:38:08,572
What is that?
那是什么？

376
00:38:08,572 --> 00:38:12,230
When I was working with the engineers, I was trying to describe this trick.
当我与工程师合作时，我试图描述这个技巧。

377
00:38:12,230 --> 00:38:20,850
And there's a turning point where normally I do one front flip and then come in for the second, but then you have to pause and then go backflip.
有一个关键转折点，通常我先做一个前空翻，然后接第二个，但这时你必须暂停，再做后空翻。

378
00:38:20,850 --> 00:38:25,070
If you miss that turning point in the trick, well, it's not good.
如果错过了这个转折点，那就不好了。

379
00:38:25,070 --> 00:38:26,330
It's not good.
不太好。

380
00:38:26,330 --> 00:38:28,470
But this really pinpoints it exactly.
但这个确实精准地指出了那个点。

381
00:38:28,470 --> 00:38:29,710
It is so cool to watch this.
看这个真是太酷了。

382
00:38:29,710 --> 00:38:33,390
And what I love is that this is making sports more accessible for fans.
我最喜欢的是，这让粉丝们更容易接触体育运动。

383
00:38:33,390 --> 00:38:36,990
We can see all of the craziness that you're putting into this sport.
我们能清楚看到你为这项运动投入的所有疯狂创意。

384
00:38:36,990 --> 00:38:37,865
Exactly.
没错。

385
00:38:37,865 --> 00:38:38,990
All right.
好的。

386
00:38:38,990 --> 00:38:41,410
So let's bring this back and talk a little bit more tech.
那么让我们回到正题，再多聊一点技术方面。

387
00:38:41,410 --> 00:38:49,130
Google Cloud is helping everyone innovate here by creating new use-case specific models, even for things like spatial analysis,
谷歌云正在通过创建针对特定应用场景的新模型，帮助每个人在这里实现创新，甚至包括空间分析等应用，

388
00:38:49,130 --> 00:39:02,040
training these large amounts of data and even models with Google Cloud TPUs, and helping everyone to build a secure data and agent foundation with Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform.
利用谷歌云 TPU 训练大量数据和模型，并帮助每个人通过 Gemini 企业智能体平台构建安全的数据与智能体基础。

389
00:39:02,040 --> 00:39:07,695
Compute, models, and platform-- this is the power of Google Cloud AI.
计算、模型与平台——这就是谷歌云 AI 的力量。

390
00:39:07,695 --> 00:39:12,820
And look, from my personal experience, I can tell you, learning a trick on the mountain is one thing,
从我个人的经验来看，我告诉你，在山上学会一个技巧是一回事，

391
00:39:12,820 --> 00:39:16,880
but actually understanding the physics of a trick is a whole other thing.
但真正理解一个技巧背后的物理原理则是完全不同的另一回事。

392
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:24,780
And this is really going to help not only the next generation of athletes learn new skills but also help the fans at home understand the sport better.
这将不仅帮助下一代运动员学习新技能，也能帮助家中的观众更好地理解这项运动。

393
00:39:24,780 --> 00:39:28,520
And not just for snowboarding, but I think sports globally.
这不仅适用于单板滑雪，我认为也适用于全球范围内的体育运动。

394
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:30,772
Look, I'm so stoked to see what's ahead.
看着未来的发展，我真是无比兴奋。

395
00:39:30,772 --> 00:39:31,480
Thank you, Jason.
谢谢你，杰森。

396
00:39:31,480 --> 00:39:34,293
And thank you, Google Cloud Next.
也谢谢谷歌云 Next。

397
00:39:39,720 --> 00:39:47,485
Please welcome SVP and chief technologist, AI and infrastructure, Amin Vahdat.
请大家欢迎高级副总裁兼首席技术官、AI与基础设施负责人阿明·瓦哈达特。

398
00:39:59,740 --> 00:40:00,990
Thank you, Shaun.
谢谢肖恩。

399
00:40:00,990 --> 00:40:06,090
We're taking the exact same technology that empowers athletes and applying it to the enterprise.
我们正将赋能运动员的同一项技术，应用于企业领域。

400
00:40:06,090 --> 00:40:11,390
Because while athletes use data to understand the game, the enterprise needs it to change the game.
因为运动员利用数据理解比赛，而企业需要数据改变比赛规则。

401
00:40:11,390 --> 00:40:15,550
That kind of scale is the ultimate stress test for a unified system.
这种规模正是对统一系统终极的压力测试。

402
00:40:15,550 --> 00:40:26,510
When you process massive video feeds, reaching over decades of historical data, and defend every byte in near real time, you have a foundation built for anything.
当你处理海量视频流，调用数十年的历史数据，并近乎实时地保护每一字节时，你就拥有了应对任何挑战的基础。

403
00:40:26,510 --> 00:40:31,070
But to solve this at a global scale, we first have to solve a physics problem.
但要在全球规模上解决这个问题，我们首先必须解决一个物理难题。

404
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:40,470
It is a constant struggle against the limits of software architecture, hardware architecture, power, cooling, and even the speed of light.
这是一场持续不断的斗争，对抗软件架构、硬件架构、功耗、散热，甚至光速的极限。

405
00:40:40,470 --> 00:40:43,950
This is the foundation of our AI Hypercomputer.
这正是我们AI超算的核心基础。

406
00:40:43,950 --> 00:40:54,020
We integrate clean energy, massive physical scale, and our purpose-built infrastructure into a single unified engine of efficiency and innovation.
我们将清洁能源、巨大的物理规模以及专为效率与创新打造的基础设施，整合为一个统一的高效引擎。

407
00:40:54,020 --> 00:40:57,820
Because in the agentic era, compute is no longer defined by chip.
因为在代理式时代，计算不再由芯片定义。

408
00:40:57,820 --> 00:41:02,140
Compute is the entire data center.
计算就是整个数据中心。

409
00:41:02,140 --> 00:41:07,005
We give you the ultimate flexibility to pick the right architecture without compromise.
我们为您提供终极灵活性，让您无需妥协即可选择合适的架构。

410
00:41:07,005 --> 00:41:11,860
You can see this in how different industry leaders are innovating on Google Cloud.
你可以看到，不同行业的领军企业正在谷歌云上不断创新。

411
00:41:11,860 --> 00:41:21,300
Axia Energia, Brazil's largest power company, helps prevent power outages for millions of customers by running advanced weather modeling on TPU clusters.
巴西最大的电力公司Axia Energia通过在TPU集群上运行先进的天气建模，帮助数百万客户避免停电。

412
00:41:21,300 --> 00:41:28,820
By forecasting severe weather conditions up to 10 days in advance, the company can proactively plan and execute preventative measures
通过提前10天预测恶劣天气，该公司能够主动规划并实施预防措施。

413
00:41:28,820 --> 00:41:35,300
before storms hit, significantly reducing service interruptions year over year.
风暴来临前就大幅减少年度服务中断。

414
00:41:35,300 --> 00:41:43,380
Thinking Machine Labs shows our NVIDIA-based infrastructure to power Tinker, an open platform for reinforcement learning and fine-tuning
思维机器实验室展示了基于英伟达的基础设施，用于支持Tinker——一个用于强化学习和微调的开源平台。

415
00:41:43,380 --> 00:41:47,250
of frontier models for specialized use cases.
面向特定应用场景的前沿模型。

416
00:41:47,250 --> 00:41:54,890
Woven by Toyota achieved 42% faster training for models that predict complex traffic events.
丰田编织（Woven by Toyota）在预测复杂交通事件的模型训练上实现了42%的提速。

417
00:41:54,890 --> 00:42:05,490
The US Department of Energy is powering AI coscientists across all 17 national labs to accelerate the pace of scientific discovery.
美国能源部正在为遍布全部17个国家实验室的AI科学家提供支持，以加速科学发现的步伐。

418
00:42:05,490 --> 00:42:16,450
And Boston Dynamics is training and safely deploying flexible vision-language models to scale robotics across diverse industrial applications.
波士顿动力正在训练并安全部署灵活的视觉语言模型，以推动机器人技术在多样化工业应用中的规模化发展。

419
00:42:16,450 --> 00:42:22,930
As we enter the agentic era, we see that the demands of training and serving have completely diverged.
进入代理式时代，我们发现训练和部署的需求已完全分化。

420
00:42:22,930 --> 00:42:31,680
To meet the performance needs of these explosive workloads, I am proud to announce our eighth-generation TPUs.
为满足这些爆发式增长工作负载的性能需求，我自豪地宣布推出第八代TPU。

421
00:42:51,490 --> 00:42:53,010
These are things of beauty.
这些都是美的杰作。

422
00:42:53,010 --> 00:43:02,050
For the very first time, we are launching two specialized platforms, each built from the ground up for the distinct demands of training and serving.
首次，我们推出了两款专用平台，每款均从零开始构建，以满足训练和推理的不同需求。

423
00:43:02,050 --> 00:43:06,090
TPU 8t is a powerhouse optimized for training.
TPU 8t 是专为训练优化的强大算力平台。

424
00:43:06,090 --> 00:43:13,370
We have redefined performance capability by moving block scale multiplication directly inside the MXUs.
我们通过将块级乘法直接移入 MXU 内部，重新定义了性能能力。

425
00:43:13,370 --> 00:43:22,730
This native MXU quantization eliminates VPU overhead, delivering nearly three times the compute performance per pod over previous generations.
这种原生 MXU 量化技术消除了 VPU 的开销，使每个计算单元的算力性能相比前代提升了近三倍。

426
00:43:22,730 --> 00:43:31,210
This allows us to push the absolute limits of model flops utilization at a massive scale and reduces the training time of frontier models.
这使我们能够在大规模下实现模型浮点运算利用率的极限，并显著缩短前沿模型的训练时间。

427
00:43:31,210 --> 00:43:45,200
It leverages our breakthrough inter-chip interconnect technology, which now delivers twice the bandwidth compared to Ironwood, scaling up to 9,600 TPUs connected via our 3D torus topology.
它采用了我们突破性的芯片间互联技术，带宽相比 Ironwood 提升了一倍，可支持高达 9,600 个 TPU 通过我们的 3D 环面拓扑连接。

428
00:43:45,200 --> 00:43:55,560
This is a 2.8x improvement over Ironwood to deliver 1.21 exaflops of FP4 compute per pod.
相比 Ironwood，性能提升了 2.8 倍，每个计算单元可提供 1.21 exaflops 的 FP4 算力。

429
00:43:55,560 --> 00:44:07,120
8t provides two petabytes of shared bandwidth memory in a single superpod and utilizes the new TPUDirect storage to enable high-speed data transfers from managed storage.
8t 在单个超级计算单元中提供两 PB 的共享带宽内存，并采用新型 TPUDirect 存储技术，实现从托管存储的高速数据传输。

430
00:44:07,120 --> 00:44:18,360
To put that scale in perspective, two petabytes is enough to hold the entire digital connection of the Library of Congress 100 times over.
从规模上看，两 PB 的存储容量足以容纳美国国会图书馆全部数字资料的 100 倍。

431
00:44:18,360 --> 00:44:23,920
TPU 8i is optimized for the thinking part of the equation-- inference and reinforcement learning.
TPU 8i 专为方程的“思考”部分优化——即推理和强化学习。

432
00:44:23,920 --> 00:44:31,520
At the chip level, we have integrated a specialized collectives acceleration engine, which reduces latency by an additional 5x.
在芯片层面，我们集成了专用的集体通信加速引擎，使延迟额外降低 5 倍。

433
00:44:31,520 --> 00:44:38,920
By hosting the memory cache entirely on silicon, we've finally broken the memory wall that slows down long-context decoding.
通过将内存缓存完全置于硅芯片上，我们终于打破了阻碍长上下文解码速度的内存墙。

434
00:44:38,920 --> 00:44:43,150
We then scaled this on-chip performance through our new board flight topology,
接着，我们通过全新的板级飞行拓扑结构，实现了芯片内性能的扩展。

435
00:44:43,150 --> 00:44:52,070
which deploys 1152 TPUs into a single pod to run millions of concurrent agents with near-zero latency.
该架构将1152个TPU部署到单个计算单元中，可实现数百万个智能体并发运行，延迟几乎为零。

436
00:44:52,070 --> 00:45:02,710
This delivers 11.6 FP8 exaflops for a substantial 9.8x increase in performance over the 256-chip Ironwood pod.
这带来了11.6 FP8艾浮点每秒的算力，相比256芯片的Ironwood计算单元，性能提升了9.8倍。

437
00:45:05,990 --> 00:45:12,590
We are extending our infrastructure leadership to general purpose workloads as well with Google Cloud Axion.
我们还将基础设施领导力延伸至通用工作负载，推出了谷歌云Axion。

438
00:45:12,590 --> 00:45:17,890
Our Google Axion N48 compute instances, powered by a custom-designed ARM CPU,
由定制设计的ARM CPU驱动的谷歌云Axion N48计算实例，

439
00:45:17,890 --> 00:45:25,950
deliver up to twice better price performance and 80% better performance per watt than comparable x86 instances.
在价格性能比上最高提升一倍，单位功耗性能比同类x86实例提升80%。

440
00:45:25,950 --> 00:45:36,710
This provides a sustained, continuous operation designed to eliminate cold starts in logic apps, ensuring your agents are always on and ready to respond.
这提供了持续稳定的运行能力，旨在消除逻辑应用中的冷启动问题，确保您的智能体始终在线并随时响应。

441
00:45:36,710 --> 00:45:43,180
We are the preferred cloud for NVIDIA GPUs by some of the largest scale and most innovative customers in the world.
我们已成为全球规模最大、最具创新性的客户中一些首选的NVIDIA GPU云服务提供商。

442
00:45:43,180 --> 00:45:51,614
Today, I am pleased to announce that Google Cloud will be among the first to offer the NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72.
今天，我很高兴宣布，谷歌云将成为首批提供英伟达Vera Rubin NVL72的云平台之一。

443
00:45:57,780 --> 00:46:06,900
Vera Rubin NVL72 on Google Cloud achieves 10 times performance efficiency, optimized for high interactivity and long-context workloads.
在谷歌云上运行的Vera Rubin NVL72实现了10倍的性能效率，专为高互动性和长上下文工作负载优化。

444
00:46:06,900 --> 00:46:09,540
Of course, silicon is only half the battle.
当然，硅芯片只是战斗的一半。

445
00:46:09,540 --> 00:46:14,180
To feed these chips, we've redesigned our entire storage and networking pipeline.
为了供给这些芯片，我们重新设计了整个存储和网络管道。

446
00:46:14,180 --> 00:46:21,500
I am pleased to announce that Managed Lustre now supports throughput up to an industry-leading 10 terabytes per second.
我很高兴地宣布，托管式 Lustre 现在支持高达行业领先的每秒 10TB 吞吐量。

447
00:46:21,500 --> 00:46:24,300
We tied it all together with our new Virgo Network.
我们通过全新的 Virgo 网络将所有部分整合在一起。

448
00:46:24,300 --> 00:46:28,820
Virgo doubles connectivity to scale training beyond the superpod.
Virgo 将连接能力翻倍，使训练规模突破超级集群的限制。

449
00:46:28,820 --> 00:46:40,010
It links 134,000 chips with up to 47pb per second of non-blocking bandwidth to deliver over 1.7 million exaflops of compute.
它连接了 13.4 万颗芯片，提供最高每秒 47PB 的无阻塞带宽，实现超过 170 万 exaflops 的算力。

450
00:46:40,010 --> 00:46:49,710
We can now turn months of training into weeks with the power of a million-plus TPU chips in a single cluster, all orchestrated by Pathways and JAX.
现在，借助单个集群中百万颗以上 TPU 芯片的算力，配合 Pathways 和 JAX 的协同调度，我们可以将数月的训练时间缩短为数周。

451
00:46:58,832 --> 00:47:08,610
With up to four times the bandwidth per accelerator over the previous generation, this combination delivers near-linear scaling, ensuring you get the full power of every chip you pay for.
相比上一代，每加速器的带宽提升高达四倍，这一组合实现了接近线性的扩展，确保您获得所支付每颗芯片的全部算力。

452
00:47:08,610 --> 00:47:18,010
We are also making Virgo available on NVIDIA, Vera Rubin, and NVL72, supporting up to 960,000 GPUs.
我们还将在英伟达、维拉·鲁宾和 NVL72 上提供 Virgo，支持最多 96 万块 GPU。

453
00:47:18,010 --> 00:47:24,290
Leading financial institutions are using this exact combination of silicon networking to gain a massive edge.
